Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||07-27-2000||01:50 AM||||Last week a fiber optic cable was cut somewhere near Toronto, Ontario. this caused one of the big providers (Rogers Cable) to have some connection problems.. since my web host gets their connection directly from Rogers, my web server has been going offline every so often for the last few days.. my mail server has too.. my regular net access isn't affected, just my web servers and my email.<P>so, if you've noticed that the fiero project isn't up.. it will be back soon. I don't know when... but hopefully within the next day or so. just thought I'd let everyone know what was going on if you've tried to visit my site, or email me in the last 48 hours.<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||4
